 that's what I'm really passionate but I  love helping entrepreneurs love  answering questions I love sharing new  information that I find that's helping  me that hopefully can help you guys as  well for your audience it may not be a  large audience and that's okay but you  want to have a specific audience in mind  when you're creating content for your  your tweets so that's first the second  thing is create awesome content so it's  not just promotional stuff if you follow  I twitter stream you're not just seen  me saying hey you know half off sale or  come by my book or whatever it's talking  more about value add information for  entrepreneurs so now i'm sharing quotes  i define inspirational i'm sharing  articles that i found helpful and useful  sharing stuff from my own website and  you know it's all value ID stuff so it's  not sales pitches that people are going  to tune that out and i think if  somebody's just blasting you with sales  information you're probably gonna tune  it out too but someone's adding value to  your life on a regular consistent basis  then you're going to want to you know  consume that more and more and the more  people you know like seen your  information the more they're going to  want to be curious about your website  curious about your products and services  want to sign up for your newsletter all  the fun stuff that comes along with it  so you know you can't have a few  promotions in there but keep the most of  it being all value I stuff again  targeted towards your audience the next  thing you can do is optimize your tweet  so what I found is you know you can send  the same tweet out at different times  during the day and have a much greater  response on one time versus the other so  i used some tools to help me find what  time of day do most of my people read my  tweets and from there i'm able to  optimize the schedules that I go out so  use this tool called crowd booster which  is free which will analyze your Twitter  records and it'll show you what times a  day to send your tweets out and give you  recommendations and then I use a tool  called buffer app which is also free  which then allows you to schedule your  tweets out at certain times so I get a  lot of money in the morning so I'll send  them out at seven eight nine a.m. and  then a couple in the afternoon as well  and that's what I found to be the best  time to me so you may be completely  different so just depends on your  audience and I use those tools to help  me get my message out so that I'm  hitting people at ideal times so  definitely a great way to go about it  because you're spending that time  creating your tweets anyway it might as  well try to hit the maximum number of  people who are following you and then  the last part is you got to promote it  so you know for my Twitter account a lot  of people will find me from searches but  most of the people will find me from the  promotions that I do so it's on my  website it's in my email it's in my  newsletter so all of your communications  you want to have your twitter address  on there to encourage people to want to  sign up and follow you it's on my  business card I don't have a phone  number of my business card but i have my  twitter account on my business card so  all of the marketing and communications  i do includes my twitter account and the  more work you do to you know marketing  from your business the more you're going  to see it come out in twitter followers  and people following you online as well  so all the offline stuff you're doing to  should include your twitter to get  people to follow you online so that's  what I've done and it's helped then it's  it's grown every month and it's exciting  and I love you know being engaged to  people I try to answer all the tweets  that come back to me so it's another one  that you can take take back with you  people feel they can have a personal  connection with you they're more likely  to want to follow you and stay engaged  so when people ask me questions I might  do a YouTube video like this or might  you know toot them back with reply and  recognize the people who are supporting  you and they'll keep supporting you and  tell their friends about it so it's a  it's definitely a process but it's  helped and it's been a lot of fun so  well that helps you guys if you liked  the video please give it a thumbs up  makes me want to do more of these videos  for you and if you have a question about  Twitter or if you want to share what  you're doing on Twitter that's been  really effective I love to hear what you  have to say if you wanted to comment  underneath this video and we'll see you  on the next episode  you
 

